# Using uv for Dependency Management

- Always add new dependencies using `uv add package-name`
- Specify version constraints (e.g., `uv add "package-name>=1.2.3"`)
- For development dependencies, use `uv add --dev package-name`
- Sync the environment with `uv sync` after pulling changes
- Keep the `uv.lock` file in version control
- Do not use `pip install` directly; it will bypass the lockfile
